     (BracketRow #usd"578100.00"  #usd"9999999999.00"  0.37 #usd"172623.50")]))

; 2024 tax rate schedules (Rev. Proc. 2023-34 § 3.01, Tables 1-4). Used for
; Schedule J base years.
; Rev. Proc. 2023-34 prints "excess over $191,150" for the 32% row of
; Tables 2-4; the base tax and the 2024 Form 1040 instructions use $191,950.
